WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.350
Hiya.

00:00.350 --> 00:05.320
This is a quick tour of the coach side of Touchline, for Tim and Deano.

00:05.320 --> 00:09.870
Everything you see here is made up example data, so no real lads.

00:10.350 --> 00:13.420
Along the bottom there are five tabs.

00:13.420 --> 00:16.400
Today, Match, Team, Train and Comms.

00:16.400 --> 00:18.470
Start every day on Today.

00:18.980 --> 00:20.780
Today is your front page.

00:20.780 --> 00:23.870
At the top are the votes: who has said yes,

00:23.870 --> 00:29.480
maybe or no to the next training and the next match, who has not answered yet,

00:29.480 --> 00:31.280
and any reasons for a no.

00:31.280 --> 00:33.080
That bit is coaches only.

00:33.580 --> 00:38.420
Underneath you get the referee reminder, the next match, the next session,

00:38.420 --> 00:41.890
anything that needs you, and the match day checklist.

00:42.390 --> 00:44.680
Match is where the fixtures live.

00:44.680 --> 00:47.510
Coming up at the top, results underneath.

00:47.510 --> 00:52.080
Tap a game to plan it, pick the side, run it live and write it up.

00:52.590 --> 00:59.120
Team holds the squad, the FA squad list, contacts, the team sheet, emergency details,

00:59.120 --> 01:02.650
head injury records, goals, stats and welfare.

01:02.650 --> 01:04.190
Again, coaches only.

01:04.690 --> 01:06.210
Train has three parts.

01:06.210 --> 01:09.960
Plan is where you build the week and check attendance.

01:09.960 --> 01:12.250
Run is what you use on the night.

01:12.250 --> 01:14.960
Library has positions, sessions, clips,

01:14.960 --> 01:18.840
resources and the Develop section for your own coaching.

01:19.350 --> 01:21.650
Comms is how you talk to families.

01:21.650 --> 01:23.480
Hub sends posts and alerts.

01:23.480 --> 01:28.910
Referees and League hold the referee contacts and the confirm by Wednesday rule.

01:28.910 --> 01:32.300
Opposition keeps a private list of other managers.

01:32.800 --> 01:38.340
Ask is for coaching questions, and More has the codes, who is on this phone, and sign out.

01:38.340 --> 01:40.930
Set Tim or Deano there once on each phone.

01:42.160 --> 01:47.290
Every page also has a How this page works box at the top if you get stuck.

01:47.290 --> 01:48.470
That is the tour.

01:48.470 --> 01:52.630
The next videos cover match day, training and sending comms.
